<title>USA: AmeriVest to buy 10-story building.</title>
<headline>AmeriVest to buy 10-story building.</headline>
<dateline>ARVADA, Colo. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmeriVest Properties Inc said Friday it entered into a letter of intent to acquire a 10-story, 87,000 square foot office building in Amarillo, Texas.</p>
<p>A statement issued by the company did not disclose the purchase price.</p>
<p>AmeriVest said it anticipates the building's annual gross revenue will be about $1,090,000 and the resulting estimated funds from operations will be about $280,000.</p>
<p>Subject to obtaining adequate financing, the acquisition is expected to close within the next three months, the company said.</p>
